{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04120","headline":"送友人尉蜀中 · 徐晶","name":"送友人尉蜀中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故友汉中尉，请爲西蜀吟。\n人家多种橘，风土爱弹琴。\n水向昆明阔，山连大夏深。\n理闲无别事，时寄一登临。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐晶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04120.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04120","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}